{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "87086507-d0ea-8709-aaeb-df14615b6a1b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-13T14:15:23-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anh Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:12:31-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:12:34-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I'm calling about a pothole. Well, it's more of a crater. My tire blew out in it on Tuesday, no, sorry, Wednesday. Wednesday evening, around six-fifteen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:12:43-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no. Okay, Wednesday evening. Let me get some details down. Where is the pothole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:12:48-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 5 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. Right in front of the house, actually, a little toward the corner. I live there, I rent the upstairs unit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:12:58-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Five Gibbs Avenue. Got it. And you said your tire blew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:13:02-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The front passenger tire blew and the rim is bent. The shop told me yesterday, Thursday, that the rim has to be replaced, not just the tire. So that's a lot more than I expected to spend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:13:14-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's frustrating, I'm sorry. Was the hole easy to see, or did it catch you by surprise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:13:20-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It caught me. It's full of water, so it just looks like a puddle. You can't tell how deep it is. It's been like that since the rain last week. Honestly, anyone would drive into it in the dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:13:33-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a puddle hides it completely. So the pothole is in the road, in front of five Gibbs, filled with water. Let me read that back: Wednesday around six-fifteen, front passenger tire, bent rim. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:13:45-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Well, one correction, it was closer to six-twenty, because I'd just checked the time when I left work. But six-fifteen is close enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:13:54-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, six-twenty. I'll put that in. I'll send this over to the crew as a road hazard so they can look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:02-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Can I ask how long repairs usually take? Like, is this days, or weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:08-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually it's a matter of days to a couple of weeks once it's on the list. March is busy because everything's thawing and the potholes are popping up all over. A hole that's a hazard like yours tends to get looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:22-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'd like it done soon, before somebody else hits it. Also, sorry, unrelated, but while I was looking at my receipts I found a coupon for forty percent off a space heater. I'm not even sure why I kept it. Anyway, that's the one good thing this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:37-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's something. Forty percent is a good deal. Now, do you want a call back once the crew has been out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:44-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. My number is 401-555-0192."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:47-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-two. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:50-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anh Okafor. A-N-H, and Okafor, O-K-A-F-O-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:14:53-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Anh. I have you at five Gibbs Avenue, pothole full of water, and I'll pass along the damage to your car too. If you want to make a claim for the rim, I can have someone get in touch about that process."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:15:07-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please do that. I have the shop's estimate and photos from Thursday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:15:12-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, keep all of that. Someone will call you. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:15:18-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T14:15:20-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
